/details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee1fe69-bf00-4ddd-b3c2-642831172e9d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee1fe69-bf00-4ddd-b3c2-642831172e9d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4a7db5ad4811441bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-17e4dbde4cccf022END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a Cabinet on the second floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Bonecloak%27s_Apothecary\" title=\"Bonecloak's Apothecary\">Bonecloak's Apothecary</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-20&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-33</span>, contingent on whether <a href=\"/wiki/Baelen_Bonecloak\" title=\"Baelen Bonecloak\">Baelen Bonecloak</a>, survives <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> and is given the <a href=\"/wiki/Noblestalk\" title=\"Noblestalk\">Noblestalk</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If Baelen was not given the <a href=\"/wiki/Noblestalk\" title=\"Noblestalk\">Noblestalk</a></i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenUnhealed</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenUnhealed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenUnhealed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4ef75ca7-1f32-4cc7-a490-089aded03514</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4ef75ca7-1f32-4cc7-a490-089aded03514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4ef75ca7-1f32-4cc7-a490-089aded03514\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dumathoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dumathoin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dumathoin\">Dumathoin</a></span> take the man! I thought when we got back to the <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">city</a> and were in familiar surroundings again that he'd mellow a bit and regain some focus.\n</p><p><br>\nBut no. He's as fuddled as ever, the old tarantula, and even more short-tempered about it than in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>. He needs my help, and he hates that—always has. I won't take it any more. If he hits me again, he's going to find some <a href=\"/wiki/Wyvern_Toxin\" title=\"Wyvern Toxin\">wyvern toxin</a> in his porridge the next morning!\n</p><p><br>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Worg\" title=\"Worg\">Worg</a> shit, did I actually write those words? I'd better hide this.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Baelen was given the <a href=\"/wiki/Noblestalk\" title=\"Noblestalk\">Noblestalk</a></i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenHealed</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenHealed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenHealed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:11cf7f6b-fc91-4993-88d5-f68b404527a0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>I know I'm no saint, never have been, and though I've always had a sharp tongue, if you asked me I'd have told I don't have a mean bone in my body. Not really mean, anyway.\n</p><p><br>\nBut look at the sorry sack of shit I have become. I guess being married to Baelen for so long left more of a mark than I thought. Even Baelen when his fury came on him never left me more than bruised, but now I feel broken.\n</p><p><br>\nAnd why, for the love of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dumathoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dumathoin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dumathoin\">Dumathoin</a></span>? Baelen is healed! He got his mind back in the Underdark, and he's his old self.\n</p><p><br>\nAnd I guess that's the problem. When he was addled, I could blame our problems on his befuddlement and how angry it made him—and me.\n</p><p><br>\nNow he's back to his old self. And his old self isn't someone I want to be around.\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Baelen died in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a></i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BonecloakApothecary_Journal_BaelenDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">cee1fe69-bf00-4ddd-b3c2-642831172e9d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee1fe69-bf00-4ddd-b3c2-642831172e9d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:cee1fe69-bf00-4ddd-b3c2-642831172e9d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p>Baelen is dead, the old hook horror. He's dead and I miss him, fool that I am. He was a cranky old son of a worg who only got crankier once he started losing his wits, he hated that he needed my help, and I hated having to help him because he was resentful rather than grateful. \n</p><p><br>\nI didn't think I'd miss him when he was gone, I told him so myself, but now there's a great big empty hole in my life that cats aren't going to fill. Damn fool, getting himself killed that way.\n</p><p><br>\nAnd now what am I going to do? I'm tempted to sample some of my own merchandise to improve my mood, as it were, but that's how Baelen got started on his slide into fuddlement, so I guess I won't.\n</p><p><br>\nI wonder if <a href=\"/wiki/To_Glumbor_from_Derryth\" title=\"To Glumbor from Derryth\">Glumbor</a> is still alive? When I was a young hottie, him being twenty years older than me seemed important, but what's twenty years to a dwarf? \n</p><p><br>\nThough with my luck,, he's probably as dead as Baelen.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212434\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revi